@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<article class="prose mx-auto">
    <h1 class="h2 mb-4">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">This is a template. Have it reviewed by counsel before going live.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Uploaded CSV files</h2>
    <p>CSV files you upload are processed in memory and held only in an encrypted, temporary workspace tied to your account. They are not saved to our database, are not visible to other users, and are deleted automatically when you sign out, end your session, or after a period of inactivity.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Information we keep</h2>
    <p>We keep your account details, company information, order and payment status, the final confirmed version of each record you complete, and security audit logs.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Payments</h2>
    <p>Card and bank details are entered directly on our PCI DSS-compliant payment processor's page. We never receive or store full card numbers or security codes.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Shared forms</h2>
    <p>Forms you share use a private, unguessable link that stops working once the form is submitted or your session ends. Recipients can see the information on the form and read-only order details, but never payment card data.</p>
</article>
